---
source: tests/snapshots.rs
description: grav init --help
expression: run(args)
---
exit: 0
--- stdout
Print shell integration that follows the explorer's directory on exit

Usage: grav init [OPTIONS] <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>  [possible values: bash, zsh, fish]

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --color <WHEN>     When to use colour [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --binary           Show sizes in powers of 1024 (KiB, MiB) instead of 1000 (kB, MB)
      --log-file <FILE>  Append diagnostic logs to FILE (filter with RUST_LOG) [env:
                         GRAVITYFILE_LOG_FILE]

Add to your shell's startup file:
  bash:  eval "$(command grav init bash)"
  zsh:   eval "$(command grav init zsh)"
  fish:  command grav init fish | source
--- stderr
